{
  "case_id": "CHIP-ECON-ON-1.20.1",
  "title": "筹码经济调整·配置开启(enable_chip_recipes=true):61 条筹码配方加载 + 创造栏 4 种材料可见",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "chip-econ"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "筹码经济调整批(CHIP-ECON)·配置开启侧(enable_chip_recipes=true)。\n\n前提(主 Agent 手工完成):把 run/<ver>/config/astral_dice-common.toml 的 enable_chip_recipes 改为 true 并**重启实例**(创造栏由**客户端**构建、读的是本机配置 ⇒ 客户端也必须重启;dev 里客户端与服务端共用 run/<ver>/config)。\n\n判据:①astral_dice:*_chip 配方 61 条全部加载(chips=61:config=1)②创造栏 dice_tab 内 4 种材料(再生试剂/导电丝/星币尘/标记涂料)全部出现(mats=4/4)。\n\n⚠️ CTAB 读数每次启动至多一次 + 需要余额落在 [770,799] 武装带 ⇒ 本用例须在**刚重启的新实例**里第一个跑(或至少是该次启动里第一个武装客户端探针的用例)。\n标签口径:本用例 tag 用 EO ⇒ 机器行前缀是 AP_EO_*(不是 AP_CL_*)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop curioreset EO",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop creset EO",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop crecipes EO",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal EO 771",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3000
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_EO_CRECIPES:chips=61:config=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "kubejs_client",
      "pattern": "AP_CSC:CTAB:mats=4/4:regen=1:wire=1:dust=1:paint=1:n=[1-9][0-9]*"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ]
}
